# bat — https://github.com/sharkdp/bat
#
# gruvbox-dark ships with bat 0.26 (`bat --list-themes`), so this needs no
# theme files installed and no `bat cache --build`.
#
# Dark only: Ghostty is pinned to Gruvbox Dark Hard, and `cat` is aliased to
# bat in fish/config.fish, so every page bat renders lands on a dark background.
--theme="gruvbox-dark"

# Show non-printables and use a compact header; --paging is set per-alias.
--style="numbers,changes,header"
